---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="NO BALL GAMES Collections | Physical Art, Clothing & Digital Collectibles"
  description="NO BALL GAMES collections: physical art, hand-painted clothing, prints, digital collectibles and future limited drops from the street-culture brand."
  current="collections"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Collections</span>
    <h1>Collect the culture before it gets cleaned up.</h1>
    <p>
      Physical pieces, digital releases, limited clothing, prints, collectibles, character drops and future archive work — all sitting under the NO BALL GAMES name.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section card-grid">
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Physical</span>
      <h3>Original art</h3>
      <p>One-of-one canvases, hand-finished works, sign-inspired pieces, character artwork and raw studio output. Each piece connects back to the street-culture roots of the brand.</p>
      <div class="coming-soon-tag">Enquire via contact</div>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Wearable</span>
      <h3>Painted clothing</h3>
      <p>Military jackets, denim, stencil garments and streetwear pieces that carry the NO BALL GAMES attitude into the real world. Limited runs, hand-finished, no mass production.</p>
      <div class="coming-soon-tag">Future drops</div>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <span class="kicker">Digital</span>
      <h3>Digital collectibles</h3>
      <p>Future-ready structure for character cards, collector passes, rarity tiers and community rewards. The lore universe drives the collectible layer.</p>
      <div class="coming-soon-tag">Coming soon</div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section split-grid">
    <article class="panel-card">
      <span class="kicker">Drop structure</span>
      <h2>Make every release feel limited.</h2>
      <p>
        The strongest version of this brand does not dump random products. It releases controlled drops with story, scarcity, proof, archive value and a clear reason to collect.
      </p>
      <p>
        Each drop connects to the lore, the characters or a specific chapter of the brand story.
      </p>
      <a class="inline-link" href={`${base}lore/`}>Explore the lore behind the drops →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="panel-card">
      <span class="kicker">Suggested categories</span>
      <ul class="list-clean">
        <li>Original one-of-one artworks.</li>
        <li>Limited prints and signed editions.</li>
        <li>Hand-painted jackets and custom garments.</li>
        <li>Character collectible drops.</li>
        <li>Community reward items and access passes.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-block">
    <div class="cta-block-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Want something specific?</span>
      <h2>Commission or enquire directly.</h2>
      <p>For original art, painted clothing or collaboration enquiries — reach out. Clear messages, real projects, honest replies.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="button primary" href={`${base}contact/`}>Send an enquiry</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href={`${base}projects/`}>View all projects</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
